  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "434eb4678a95e22c",
      "translationZh": "试用 Google Pics：在 Google Workspace 中轻松创建和编辑图像",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a4f916e1b430841",
      "translationZh": "以无与伦比的精度生成、优化并共同创作图像。此外，即将推出的 Workspace 集成功能将让你直接在 Google Slides、Docs 和 Drive 中创建和编辑图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b690207084f7710e",
      "translationZh": "Google Pics 产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa54f0e9d9f2a71a",
      "translationZh": "Google Pics 是一款用于在 Workspace 中创建和编辑图像的新 AI 工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0dbae07e90527b1f",
      "translationZh": "你现在可以使用简单的文本提示生成和优化自定义图形。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e6254b339fcc690",
      "translationZh": "轻松分离对象、编辑文字，或直接翻译图像中的文字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eb9ab8fb7f2dc295",
      "translationZh": "无需离开你喜爱的 Google 应用，即可与团队协作设计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f806a6d1e61d7b0b",
      "translationZh": "立即访问 pics.new，在 Docs 和 Slides 中使用这些强大的功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b4595f60d727363",
      "translationZh": "Google 刚刚推出了一款名为 Google Pics 的新工具，利用 AI 帮助你创建和编辑图像。你可以用它制作社交媒体帖子或修整插画，无需具备专业技能。它直接内置于 Docs 和 Slides 等应用中，因此你不必切换标签页就能完成工作。你甚至可以与朋友一起协作编辑同一张图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "649986d552d04e31",
      "translationZh": "Google Pics——我们来自 Google Workspace 的图像创建和编辑工具——将在未来几周内逐步向所有 Google AI Pro 和 Ultra 订阅用户以及大多数 Workspace 企业客户开放。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd7ad257f8a73a3b",
      "translationZh": "Pics 基于我们的 Nano Banana 图像生成和编辑模型构建，为你提供所需的控制能力，让你能够创作出想象中的任何内容，无论是设计海报、制作社交媒体帖子，还是编辑数字插画。Google Pics 既会作为独立产品提供，也会集成到 Workspace 应用中，首先支持 Slides、Docs 和 Drive，让你能够直接在当前工作的应用中编辑图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e3eb6dd88bf4fdf",
      "translationZh": "精准控制与易用性兼得",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ed4989dd6ccb9f7",
      "translationZh": "Google Pics 提供一整套可精细调整的编辑功能，让你能够生成图像并进行精准编辑，而不必从头开始。以下是一些值得期待的功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a06c7a24d057a021",
      "translationZh": "观看如何利用 Google Pics 强大的编辑控件，即时创建和优化自定义图形。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a85cf5a92332e09",
      "translationZh": "使用 Google Pics，轻松设计和精细调整引人注目的社交媒体内容和数字公告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "118113bd04fdc7f6",
      "translationZh": "对象分割：Pics 让你能够轻松分离出某个对象并对其进行变换，而不改变图像的其余部分。你可以针对特定区域输入文字批注，提出有针对性的修改要求，并同时执行多项编辑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5dc2ab4e8c92e30f",
      "translationZh": "图像内文字编辑与翻译：直接在图像内修改或翻译文字，而不破坏设计或改变字体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de48b6cbbc0ddb80",
      "translationZh": "与他人协作：将 Pics 作品分享给朋友和队友，然后共同编辑同一张图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b812b1a6f4c43af",
      "translationZh": "多方案生成：Pics 可根据一条提示词生成多个方案，让你从多种迭代结果中选出最喜欢的一个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7efaa78b1f021044",
      "translationZh": "与 Google Workspace 无缝集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bccc9388689a31f",
      "translationZh": "每个月，数百万用户都会在 Workspace 产品中与数十亿张图片互动。为了让这一体验更加流畅，我们正将 Google Pics 直接引入你已经在使用的工具中。你不应该为了创作和分享视觉内容而在应用之间来回切换。现在，你可以直接在当前使用的工具中利用强大的 AI 图像生成和编辑功能，无需复制、粘贴或切换标签页。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71b67c7b45794d26",
      "translationZh": "了解如何直接在 Slides、Docs 以及即将支持的 Drive 等 Workspace 应用中流畅地编辑图片和产品模型图，而无需切换标签页。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c4b3f12e69246c4",
      "translationZh": "将文件从 Google Drive 直接拖入 Google Pics，设计品牌概念，加快你的工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c846718366cdc8aa",
      "translationZh": "用 Google Pics 创作你能想象到的一切。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "666b19034cb65d0a",
      "translationZh": "这项集成功能从今天起在 Docs 和 Slides 中上线，并将在未来几周内推广至 Drive。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8f9ed692bb804e4",
      "translationZh": "我们迫不及待想看看你会创作出什么。前往 pics.new 试用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中接收 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看你的收件箱以确认订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "04ad4e0e50ececce",
      "translationZh": "用语音在 Gmail、Docs 和 Keep 中完成更多任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7aff2425f36a647a",
      "translationZh": "面向政府和企业的主动网络防御",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "892c6f3a5093583b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 8 月公布的最新 AI 消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91979947e61b341b",
      "translationZh": "作者：News from Google 团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "73148f081290b3ff",
      "translationZh": "在 Search 中规划和预订旅行的 3 种新方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c51c17d89233482d",
      "translationZh": "使用 Workspace 中的 Gemini 开启返校季的 7 种方式",
